status: experimental
description: |
  Detects potential post-exploitation activity following Chrome/Chromium sandbox escape.
  CVE-2026-5281 is a use-after-free vulnerability in Google Dawn (GPU abstraction layer).
  While the exploit itself (memory corruption) is not directly detectable via SIEM logs,
  this rule identifies suspicious process behavior after successful sandbox escape.

