### **Then in sigconverter.io:**
1. Paste that YAML
2. Select "Splunk" backend
3. Get SPL output like:
```spl
(ParentImage="*\\chrome.exe" OR ParentImage="*\\chromium.exe" OR ParentImage="*\\msedge.exe") 
(Image="*cmd.exe" OR Image="*powershell.exe" OR Image="*systeminfo.exe" OR Image="*whoami.exe" OR Image="*ipconfig.exe") 
NOT (CommandLine="*--flag-switches*" OR CommandLine="*--user-data-dir*" OR CommandLine="*chrome://flags*")
```

