## Quick Reference: Field Names by Log Source

| Log Source | Product | Common Fields | Use Case |
|-----------|---------|---|---|
| `process_creation` | windows | ParentImage, Image, CommandLine, TargetFilename | Execution, spawning, file write |
| `web_access` | web_application | uri, method, status, User-Agent | Web app exploitation |
| `network_connection` | zeek/suricata | dest_ip, dest_port, protocol | Network pivoting, C2 |
| `file_event` | windows | TargetFilename, CreationTime, Hashes | Ransomware, webshell upload |
| `registry_event` | windows | TargetObject, EventType, Details | Persistence, UAC bypass |
| `image_load` | windows | ImageLoaded, Signed, Signature | DLL injection, living-off-the-land |
| `dns_query` | zeek | query, record_type, rcode | C2 beaconing, exfil |

